<title>UK: BSkyB 1st-half pre-tax profit rises 26 pct.</title>
<headline>BSkyB 1st-half pre-tax profit rises 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.1		    vs 5.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.75		   vs 2.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     133.7		  vs 106.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   585.6		  vs 463.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits for BSkyB in a range between 131 and 138 million stg. The pay television operator said the total number of paying subscribers increased by 580,000 in the interim period and by 434,000 in the three months to December 31.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
